𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 — Tablet YBC 7289: The Diagonal of the Square
𒑰 Calculates the Babylonian approximation of sqrt(2): 1;24,51,10

𒂊𒁹

    initial-estimate : 1;30
    steps : 3
    target-diagonal : 30

    approx :
        initial-estimate
        steps
        𒀝 babylonian-sqrt

    diagonal :
        target-diagonal
        approx
        𒊭

𒁾𒊬 babylonian-sqrt start iterations:

    x : start
    two : 2
    half : 0;30

    𒄀 step 𒋫 1 𒂗 iterations:
        next-x :
            x
            two
            x
            𒉌
            𒍣
            half
            𒊭
        x : next-x

    𒉆 x

𒅗𒁹

    𒁹𒀀 "Babylonian sqrt(2) approximation:"
    𒁹𒀀 approx

    𒁹𒀀 "Square with side 30 has diagonal:"
    𒁹𒀀 diagonal
